{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026T4gyuMPTjS1795535258.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>宜家家居在尖沙咀K11藝術購物館分店的美食站，一個雪糕樣本大腸菌群含量超標。</p><p></p><p>食安中心指，結果顯示大腸菌群含量為每克一百五十個，超出每克不可含有多於一百個大腸菌群的法例上限。中心已知會店鋪，即時停售及銷毀所有有問題的雪糕。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T16:44:26.263281+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T14:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T17:37:37.364660+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T16:37:40.975327+00:00","content_hash":"8abbe79e7a7c7b3322ccb64d922a3f2eb77f459934bff3a94a2871a768ae5ce4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T16:44:26.263281+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}